# Git conventions

Read `docs/agents/git/conventions.md`.

Do not commit on trunk (main).

Subject: `type(scope): imperative summary` — no Linear id in subject.

Branch: Linear copy-branch when the work ties to a Linear issue; else `type/scope-description`.

Secondary Linear: `Fixes KMD-###` or `Refs KMD-###` in commit body and/or PR description.

PR title = commit subject. Never `git commit --no-verify`.

Preflight: `printf '%s' "<message>" | yarn commitlint`
